@host = http://localhost:5109

### 1. Log in to get a JWT (copy the token into @token below)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

###
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 2. Verify the token
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────── CARS ───────────────────────────────
### Cars use multipart/form-data so the photo travels in the SAME request.
### Tip: Swagger is the easiest way to pick a file — it shows a Choose-file button.

### List all cars (public)
GET {{host}}/api/Cars

### Only cars available to rent (used by the mobile app)
GET {{host}}/api/Cars/available

### Filter by status: Available | Rented | UnderMaintenance
GET {{host}}/api/Cars?status=Available

### Get one car
GET {{host}}/api/Cars/1

### Create a car WITHOUT a photo
POST {{host}}/api/Cars
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CarForm

--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

Camry 2024
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="brand"

Toyota
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePerDay"

150.00
--CarForm--

### Create a car WITH a photo in the same request
### (put the image file next to this .http file, or adjust the path)
POST {{host}}/api/Cars
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CarForm

--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

Sonata 2025
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="brand"

Hyundai
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePerDay"

120.00
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="car.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./car.jpg
--CarForm--

### Update a car — leave "image" out to KEEP the photo, "status" out to KEEP the status
PUT {{host}}/api/Cars/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CarForm

--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

Camry 2024
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="brand"

Toyota
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePerDay"

175.00
--CarForm--

### Remove a car's photo (removeImage=true)
PUT {{host}}/api/Cars/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CarForm

--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

Camry 2024
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="brand"

Toyota
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePerDay"

175.00
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="removeImage"

true
--CarForm--

### Take a car out of circulation
PUT {{host}}/api/Cars/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CarForm

--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

Camry 2024
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="brand"

Toyota
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="pricePerDay"

175.00
--CarForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

UnderMaintenance
--CarForm--

### Delete a car (409 if it has any rental history; its photo file is removed too)
DELETE {{host}}/api/Cars/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ───────────────────────────── CUSTOMERS ────────────────────────────

### List customers (admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Anas Sadeq",
  "email": "anas@example.com",
  "phone": "0500000000"
}

### Update a customer
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Anas S.",
  "email": "anas@example.com",
  "phone": "0500000001"
}

### Delete a customer (409 if they have rentals)
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ────────────────────────────── RENTALS ─────────────────────────────

### Book a car. TotalPrice is calculated by the server.
POST {{host}}/api/rentals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carId": 1,
  "customerId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-08"
}

### List all rentals (admin)
GET {{host}}/api/rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One customer's rental history
GET {{host}}/api/rentals/customer/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one rental
GET {{host}}/api/rentals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change the rental period (TotalPrice is recalculated; status preserved)
PUT {{host}}/api/rentals/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-10"
}

### Complete the rental — releases the car back to Available
PUT {{host}}/api/rentals/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel the rental — also releases the car
PUT {{host}}/api/rentals/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a rental (frees its car if it was active)
DELETE {{host}}/api/rentals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────── OTHER ──────────────────────────────

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health
